 "獣欲": "شَهْوَة (A feeling of strong desire, especially such a feeling driven by sexual arousal.) / شَهْوَة (A general want or longing, not necessarily sexual.)  [lust]",
 "獣狩り": "صَيْد (The act of finding and killing a wild animal, either for sport or with the inten)  [hunting (of animals such as boar, deer, etc.)]",
 "獣畜": "مَوَاشٍ, أَنْعَام (Farm animals; animals domesticated for cultivation.)  [livestock]",
 "獣皮": "أَخْفَى, خَبَأَ (To put (something) in a place where it will be out of sight or harder to discove) / اِخْتَبَأَ (To put oneself in a place where one will be out of sight or harder to find.) / إِهَاب, جِلْد (The skin of an animal.)  [hide]",
