 "王手": "تَفَقُّد (An inspection or examination.) / كِشّ مَلِك (A situation in which the king is directly threatened by an opposing piece.) / فَاتُورَة, حِسَاب (A bill, particularly in a restaurant.) / اِسْتَأْنَى, دَقَّقَ (To inspect; to examine.) / كَشَّ (To make a move which puts an adversary's king in check; to put in check.)  [check]\nمثال: 王手をかけられたほうは、玉を逃げるなどの方法で王手を防がねばなりません。\n→ The checked player must find a way for the king to escape and block the check.",
