 "王者": "مَلِك, شاه (A component of certain games.) / مَلِك (A component of certain games.)  [king]\nمثال: カリフォルニアには有名な大木、つまり、いわゆる森の王者がある。\n→ In California are the famous big trees, or \"forest kings\" as they are called. / نَصِير, نَصِيرَة (Someone who fights for a cause or status.)  [champion]",
