 "玩ぶ": "[to play with (a toy, one's hair, etc.) ; to fiddle with]\nمثال: 猫は生きたネズミをもて遊んでいた。\n→ The cat was playing with a live mouse. / [to toy with (another's emotions, etc.) ; to trifle with]\nمثال: あなたは彼の気持ちを弄んではいけない。\n→ You should not trifle with his feelings. / [to do with something as one pleases]\nمثال: 私は数奇な運命にもてあそばれてきた。\n→ I have lived a life of a puppet of fortune. / قَدَّرَ (To be grateful or thankful for.) / قَدَّرَ (To view as valuable.) / عَلِمَ (To be fully conscious of; understand; be aware of; detect.) / رَفَعَ قِيمَة, زَادَ فِي قِيمَة (To increase in value.)  [to appreciate]",
 "玩具": "لُعْبَة, دُمْيَة (Something to play with, especially as intended for use by a child.)  [toy]\nمثال: その工場は玩具を製造している。\n→ The factory manufactures toys. / [(person or thing treated as a) plaything]",
