 "珍希": "نَادِر (Very uncommon; scarce.)  [rare]",
 "珍無類": "اِسْتِثْنَائِيّ, غَيْرُ عَادِيّ (Out of the ordinary; exceptional; unusual.)  [extraordinary]",
 "珍稀": "نَادِر (Very uncommon; scarce.)  [rare]",
 "珍糞漢": "رَطَانَة (Speech or writing that is unintelligible, incoherent or meaningless.) / ثَرْثَرَة, بَرْبَرَة (Needlessly obscure or overly technical language.)  [gibberish]",
 "珍紛漢": "رَطَانَة (Speech or writing that is unintelligible, incoherent or meaningless.) / ثَرْثَرَة, بَرْبَرَة (Needlessly obscure or overly technical language.)  [gibberish]",
 "珍談": "نَادِرَة (short account of an incident) / أُطْرُوفَة (short account of an incident) / أُفْكُوهَة (short account of an incident) / طُرْفَة (short account of an incident) / فُكَاهَة (short account of an incident) / لَطِيفَة (short account of an incident)  [anecdote]",
