 "珍重": "سَلِيبَة (That which is taken from another; something captured; a thing seized by force, s) / غَنِيمَة (Anything captured by a belligerent using the rights of war; especially, property) / جَائِزَة, مُكَافَأَة (An honour or reward striven for in a competitive contest; anything offered to be)  [prizing]",
 "珠": "ضَرَّة (A roundish, protuberant portion of some part of the body.)  [ball] / قَطْرَة (small quantity of liquid, just large enough to hold its own ) / نُقْطَة (small quantity of liquid, just large enough to hold its own ) / أَسْقَطَ (to let (something) fall; to allow (something) to fall (eithe)  [drop]\nمثال: 彼の額には玉のような汗が浮かんでいた。\n→ There were beads of sweat on his forehead. / ضَرَّة (A roundish, protuberant portion of some part of the body.)  [ball (in sports)]\nesp. 球 / كَوْم (A mass of things heaped together; a heap.)  [pile (of noodles, etc.)]",
