 "現": "وَاقِع, حَقِيقَة (The state of being actual or real; realness.) / وَاقِع (The entirety of all that is real.)  [reality]",
 "現す": "مَثَّلَ (To stand or act in the place of; to perform the duties, exercise the rights, or )  [to represent]\nesp. 表す, 表わす\nمثال: ＆のマークはａｎｄの文字を表す。\n→ The sign \"&\" stands for \"and\". / كَشَفَ (To uncover; to show and display that which was hidden or unknown.) / أَوْحَى, أَنْزَلَ (To communicate that which could not be known or discovered without divine or sup)  [to reveal]\nesp. 現す, 現わす\nمثال: ご自分の栄光を現された。\n→ He thus revealed his glory. / عَبَّرَ (To convey or communicate; to make known or explicit.)  [to express]\nesp. 表す, 表わす\nمثال: あなたのご親切に対し深く感謝の意を表します。\n→ I wish to express my deep appreciation for your kindness. / [to make widely known]\nesp. 顕す",
