 "現に": "فِعْلًا (In act or in fact; really; in truth; positively.)  [actually]",
 "現る": "ظَهَرَ (To come or be in sight; to be in view; to become visible.) / ظَهَرَ, بَدَا (To seem; to have a certain semblance; to look.)  [to appear] / [to be expressed (e.g. emotions) ; to become apparent (e.g. trends, effects)]",
 "現れ": "تَجَسَّد (A physical entity typifying an abstract concept.)  [embodiment]\nمثال: それは彼女の性格の表れだ。\n→ It is an index of her character.",
 "現れる": "ظَهَرَ (To come or be in sight; to be in view; to become visible.) / ظَهَرَ, بَدَا (To seem; to have a certain semblance; to look.)  [to appear]\nمثال: ２０人の警官が現場に現れた。\n→ Twenty police have arrived on the scene. / [to be expressed (e.g. emotions) ; to become apparent (e.g. trends, effects)]\nمثال: その薬の効きめが現れた。\n→ The medicine took effect.",
 "現れ出る": "ظَهَرَ (To come or be in sight; to be in view; to become visible.) / ظَهَرَ, بَدَا (To seem; to have a certain semblance; to look.)  [to appear]\nمثال: その作品でついに彼女の才能が現われ出た。\n→ Her true talent was finally revealed in that painting.",
 "現わす": "مَثَّلَ (To stand or act in the place of; to perform the duties, exercise the rights, or )  [to represent]\nesp. 表す, 表わす\nمثال: ＆のマークはａｎｄの文字を表す。\n→ The sign \"&\" stands for \"and\". / كَشَفَ (To uncover; to show and display that which was hidden or unknown.) / أَوْحَى, أَنْزَلَ (To communicate that which could not be known or discovered without divine or sup)  [to reveal]\nesp. 現す, 現わす\nمثال: ご自分の栄光を現された。\n→ He thus revealed his glory. / عَبَّرَ (To convey or communicate; to make known or explicit.)  [to express]\nesp. 表す, 表わす\nمثال: あなたのご親切に対し深く感謝の意を表します。\n→ I wish to express my deep appreciation for your kindness. / [to make widely known]\nesp. 顕す",
 "現われ": "تَجَسَّد (A physical entity typifying an abstract concept.)  [embodiment]\nمثال: それは彼女の性格の表れだ。\n→ It is an index of her character.",
 "現われる": "ظَهَرَ (To come or be in sight; to be in view; to become visible.) / ظَهَرَ, بَدَا (To seem; to have a certain semblance; to look.)  [to appear]\nمثال: ２０人の警官が現場に現れた。\n→ Twenty police have arrived on the scene. / [to be expressed (e.g. emotions) ; to become apparent (e.g. trends, effects)]\nمثال: その薬の効きめが現れた。\n→ The medicine took effect.",
 "現われ出る": "ظَهَرَ (To come or be in sight; to be in view; to become visible.) / ظَهَرَ, بَدَا (To seem; to have a certain semblance; to look.)  [to appear]\nمثال: その作品でついに彼女の才能が現われ出た。\n→ Her true talent was finally revealed in that painting.",
 "現下": "[the present time] / تَيَّار (The part of a fluid that moves continuously in a certain direction, especially () / جَارٍ (Existing or occurring at the moment.)  [current]",
 "現人神": "قَيْصَر, إِمْبْرَاطُور (Specifically, the ruler of the Holy Roman Empire; the world-monarch.)  [emperor] / [miracle-working god (who appears as the occasion demands)]",
 "現今": "حَالِيّ, حَاضِر (Relating to now, for the time being; current.) / مَوْجُود, حَاضِر (Located in the immediate vicinity.) / الزَّمَان, الْحَال (The current moment or period of time.) / قَدَّمَ, طَرَحَ (To bring (someone) into the presence of (a person); to introduce formally.)  [the present (day or age)]",
 "現代": "الْيَوْمَ, النهارده (On the current day or date.) / حَاضِر, الأيام دي (In the current era; nowadays; these days.) / الْيَوْم (today (noun)) / النهرده (today (noun)) / اليوم (today (noun)) / اليوم (today (noun)) / هاد النهار (today (noun))  [today]\nمثال: 私は現代の音楽はあまり好きではない事を認めます。\n→ I must admit I don't like much contemporary music. / [modern era ; modern times]\nمثال: 私達が住んでいる現代に入ってから、私達は国際論争の結末として、２度の世界大戦を体験した。\n→ In modern times we have gone through two world wars as the end result of international disputes.",
 "現代化": "تَحْدِيث (The act, process, or result of modernizing.)  [modernization]",
 "現代用語": "مُوَلَّدَة (A word or phrase which has recently been coined; a new word or phrase.) / تَوْلِيد (The act or instance of coining, or uttering a new word.)  [neologism]",
 "現代的": "عَصْرِيّ, حَدِيث (Pertaining to a current or recent time and style; not ancient.)  [modern]\nمثال: デザインも、アーチ型のロゴデザインにより現代的で「登場感」「躍動感」のあるものに仕上げました。\n→ The design was also given the finishing touch to have launch impact and dynamism provided by the novelty of the arch shaped logo design.",
 "現住所": "خُطْبَة, نِدَاء (Direction.) / عُنْوَان, عِنْوَان (Direction.) / عَنْوَنَ (To direct in writing, as a letter; to superscribe, or to direct and transmit.)  [(present) address]\nمثال: あなたの現住所を教えてください。\n→ Please tell me your present address.",
 "現像": "إِعْمَار, تَعْمِير (The process of developing; growth, directed change.)  [development (of film)]\nمثال: このフィルムを現像してもらえますか。\n→ Can I have this film developed?",
 "現出": "ظُهُور (The act of appearing or coming into sight; the act of becoming visible to the ey) / مَظْهَر (A thing seen; a phenomenon; an apparition.) / مَظْهَر, شَكْل (The way something looks; personal presence) / شَكْل (Apparent likeness; the way which something or someone appears to others.)  [appearance]",
 "現品": "[actual article] / جَرْد, خَزِين (A store or supply.) / مَخْزُون (A store or supply.) / مَرَقَة, حَسَاء (The raw material from which things are made, such as feedstock.) / مَنْثُور (Any of the several species of cruciferous flowers in the genus Matthiola.) / قَنْدَاق (A bar, stick, or rod.)  [stocks]",
 "現在": "حَالِيّ, حَاضِر (Relating to now, for the time being; current.) / مَوْجُود, حَاضِر (Located in the immediate vicinity.) / الزَّمَان, الْحَال (The current moment or period of time.) / قَدَّمَ, طَرَحَ (To bring (someone) into the presence of (a person); to introduce formally.)  [the present]\nمثال: 私は現在の地位に満足している。\n→ I am content with my current position. / اِعْتِبَارًا مِن (from a specified time) / اِبْتِدَاءً مِن (from a specified time)  [as of]\nafter a time, date, etc.\nمثال: 与党は５時現在で５０議席確保している。\n→ The ruling party has secured 50 seats as of 5 o'clock. / مُضَارِع, فِعْل مُضَارِع (A grammatical tense whose principal function is to locate a situation or event i)  [present tense] / [this world ; this life]",
 "現在形": "مُضَارِع, فِعْل مُضَارِع (A grammatical tense whose principal function is to locate a situation or event i)  [present tense]\nمثال: 「すべき」というのは、現在形で書かれている論文も散見されるからです。\n→ I say \"should\", because theses written in the present tense are still seen around and about.",
 "現在時制": "حَالِيّ, حَاضِر (Relating to now, for the time being; current.) / مَوْجُود, حَاضِر (Located in the immediate vicinity.) / الزَّمَان, الْحَال (The current moment or period of time.) / قَدَّمَ, طَرَحَ (To bring (someone) into the presence of (a person); to introduce formally.)  [present]\nمثال: このような場合は“現在時制”を使います。\n→ We use the present tense for this kind of case.",
 "現在時刻": "الْآنَ, حَالًا (At the present time.) / بِمَا أَنّ, أَمَا وَأَنّ (Since, because, in light of the fact.)  [now]",
 "現在進行形": "[present continuous tense ; present progressive form]\nمثال: ここで使われている文法形式は現在進行形である。\n→ The grammatical form employed here is the present progressive. / نَشِيط, عَامِل (Having the power or quality of acting; causing change; communicating action or m) / نَشِيط (Quick in physical movement; of an agile and vigorous body; nimble.) / حَرِك (Given to action rather than contemplation; practical; operative) / فَارِه, حَرِك (Brisk; lively.)  [(currently) active]",
 "現地": "بُقْعَة (A round or irregular patch on the surface of a thing having a different color, t)  [the spot]\nمثال: 現地企業でのインターンシップを体験する。\n→ I'm going to do an internship at a local company. / [place where one is currently living]",
