 "甘甘": "حُلْو (Having a pleasant smell; fragrant.) / حَلْوَى (A confection made from sugar, or high in sugar content; a candy.)  [sweet]",
 "甘皮": "بُشَيْرَة (The outermost layer of the skin of vertebrates.)  [cuticle (of a nail)] / [endocarp]",
