 "甘美": "حُلْو (Having a pleasant smell; fragrant.) / حَلْوَى (A confection made from sugar, or high in sugar content; a candy.)  [sweet (taste)]\nمثال: バラの花は満開よりも蕾の方が甘美である。\n→ A rose is sweeter in the bud than full blown. / حُلْو (Having a pleasant smell; fragrant.) / حَلْوَى (A confection made from sugar, or high in sugar content; a candy.)  [sweet (melody, dream, etc.)]",
