 "甘草": "عِرْقْسُوس, نَبَات اَلسُّوس (A type of candy made from that plant's dried root or its extract.)  [licorice]",
 "甘菜": "شَمَنْدَر اَلسُّكَّر (A type of beet whose root contains a high concentration of sucrose.)  [sugar beet]",
