 "甘薯": "بَطَاطَا حُلْوَة (A tropical perennial American vine, Ipomoea batatas, having a fleshy tuber.)  [sweet potato (Ipomoea batatas)]\nمثال: この薩摩芋は生焼けでがりがりする。\n→ This sweet potato is only half-baked and is still crunchy.",
