 "生ぬるい": "فَاتِر (Between warm and cool.)  [lukewarm] / ضَعِيف (Lacking in force (usually strength) or ability.) / ضَعِيف (Dilute, lacking in taste or potency.)  [weak] / مُعْتَدِل (Moderately warm, especially less cold than expected.)  [mild]",
 "生のままで": "مُسْتَقِيم (Not crooked, curly, or bent; having a constant direction throughout its length.) / عَلَى طُول (Of a direction relative to the subject, precisely; as if following a direct line)  [straight (e.g. whiskey)]",
 "生まれ": "وِلَادَة, مَوْلِد (The process of childbearing; the beginning of life; the emergence of a human bab) / وِلَادَة, بدايَة (A beginning or start; a point of origin.) / وَلَدَ, وَضَعَ (To bear or give birth to (a child).)  [birth]\nمثال: 私は生まれも育ちも東京だ。\n→ I was born and raised in Tokyo. / [born in (country, month, imperial era, zodiac year, etc.)]",
