 "生み": "وِلَادَة, مَوْلِد (The process of childbearing; the beginning of life; the emergence of a human bab) / وِلَادَة, بدايَة (A beginning or start; a point of origin.) / وَلَدَ, وَضَعَ (To bear or give birth to (a child).)  [birth]\nمثال: その生みの国であるドイツでは、ホット・ドッグは「フランクフルター」と呼ばれていた。\n→ In its home country of Germany, the hot dog was called the frankfurter. / خَلَقَ (to put into existence)  [creating]",
 "生みつける": "وَضَعَ (To place down in a position of rest, or in a horizontal position.) / وَضَعَ (To produce and deposit an egg or eggs.)  [to lay]",
 "生みの子": "[one's child ; a child one has brought into the world] / سَلِيل (One of the progeny of a specified person, at any distance of time or through any)  [descendant]",
 "生みの親": "[biological parent] / مُؤَسِّس, مُؤَسِّسَة (One who founds or establishes (a company, project, organisation, state, etc.).)  [founder]",
 "生み付ける": "وَضَعَ (To place down in a position of rest, or in a horizontal position.) / وَضَعَ (To produce and deposit an egg or eggs.)  [to lay]",
 "生み出す": "خَلَقَ (to put into existence)  [to create]\nمثال: このことがよい人間関係を生みだす。\n→ This makes good human relations. / اِخْتَرَعَ (To design a new process or mechanism.)  [to invent]\nمثال: あなたはそのチームを誰が生み出したか知っていますか。\n→ Do you know who brought that team into being? / دُبّ (large mammal of family Ursidae) / دُبَّة (large mammal of family Ursidae) / اِحْتَمَلَ (To support, sustain, or endure.)  [to bear]",
 "生み落とす": "قَطْرَة (small quantity of liquid, just large enough to hold its own ) / نُقْطَة (small quantity of liquid, just large enough to hold its own ) / أَسْقَطَ (to let (something) fall; to allow (something) to fall (eithe)  [to drop (a calf, foal, etc.)]",
 "生む": "وَلَدَ (produce new life) / أَنْجَبَ (produce new life)  [to give birth] / أَنْتَجَ, صَنَعَ (To bring forth, to yield, make, manufacture, or otherwise generate.)  [to produce]\nمثال: その貸付金は、８分の利益を生む。\n→ The loan bears an 8% interest.",
 "生やさしい": "أَبْلَه (Free from duplicity; guileless, innocent, straightforward.)  [simple]",
 "生やす": "نَمَى ((intransitive) to become bigger) / كَبُرَ ((intransitive) to become bigger)  [to grow]\nمثال: あごひげをはやした神様は自分が離れたのと同じ方法で戻ってくると約束していた。\n→ The bearded god had promised to return someday in the same way he had left. / [to let grow (e.g. weeds)]",
 "生り": "دُبّ (large mammal of family Ursidae) / دُبَّة (large mammal of family Ursidae) / اِحْتَمَلَ (To support, sustain, or endure.)  [bearing (fruit)]",
