 "生命": "حَياة (Nature, reality, and the forms that exist in it.)  [life]\nمثال: 生命はいつ誕生したのですか。\n→ When did life come into being? / مِهْنَة, مسار مهني (One’s calling in life; one's working occupation or profession, especially when p)  [career] / رُوح, نَفْس (The spirit or essence of a person usually thought to consist of one's thoughts a) / سول (Soul music.)  [soul]\nocc. read いのち",
 "生命保険": "تَأْمِين عَلَى اَلْحَيَاة (A form of insurance on the life of a person, whereby if the person dies then the)  [life insurance]\nمثال: その会社は全社員に対して健康保険と生命保険をかけている。\n→ The company provides health and life insurance benefits for all of its employees.",
