 "生地": "قُمَاش, أقمشة (A fabric, usually made of woven, knitted, or felted fibres or filaments, such as) / مِمْسَحَة (A piece of cloth used for a particular purpose.)  [cloth]\nمثال: 生地を預ければドレスを仕立ててくれますか。\n→ Will you make me up a dress if I give you the material? / عَجِين, عَجِينَة (A thick, malleable substance made by mixing flour with other ingredients such as)  [dough]\nمثال: イースト菌がパン生地を膨らます。\n→ Yeast makes dough rise. / [inherent quality ; one's true character] / [unglazed pottery]",
