 "生年月日": "تَارِيخُ الْمِيلَادِ, تَارِيخُ مِيلَادِ (The date and year on which something or someone was born.)  [date of birth]\nمثال: 生年月日は１９６０年２月１４日です。\n→ I was born on February 14, 1960.",
 "生彩": "جاذِبيّة (Shining beauty, splendor, attractiveness or attraction.) / إشْراق, تَهْذِيب (Polish, social refinement.)  [luster]\nesp. 精彩\nمثال: これが彼の話し方に生彩をそえている。\n→ This adds color to his speech. / حَياة (Nature, reality, and the forms that exist in it.)  [life]\nمثال: 彼、今日、精彩がないね。青菜に塩だね。\n→ He seems really depressed and lifeless today. I wonder what took the wind out of his sails.",
