 "生態": "عِلْم اَلْبِيئَة (The branch of biology dealing with the relationships of organisms with their env)  [ecology]\nمثال: 第二が周辺環境との親和性であり、最小の廃棄物、自然エネルギーの利用等、周辺の生態と調和した住空間を形成することである。\n→ The second is the affinity with environment. By utilizing natural energy and reducing wastes, we have to make houses which harmonize with… / [mode of life ; way of living]",
 "生態学": "عِلْم اَلْبِيئَة (The branch of biology dealing with the relationships of organisms with their env)  [ecology]\nمثال: 世界の熱帯雨林は、この惑星上の生命が形成する生態学的な連鎖の中で、かけがえのない環をなしているのである。\n→ The world's tropical rainforests are critical links in the ecological chain of life on the planet.",
