 "生毛": "تَحْتَ, تَحْت (From a higher position to a lower one; downwards.) / حَتَى, إِلَى (From one end to another of (in any direction); along.) / سقط (to drop) / زَغَب (Soft, fluffy immature feathers which grow on young birds. Used as insulating mat) / زَغَب (The pubescence of plants; the hairy crown or envelope of the seeds of certain pl) / زَغَب (The soft hair of the face when beginning to appear.)  [down]\nمثال: 孵化後まもないヒナは、産毛が濡れていますが、２時間もすると乾いてフワフワになります。\n→ The down of chicks that have just hatched is damp, but after two hours it dries out and becomes fluffy. / [lanugo]",
