 "申し述べる": "وَضْع (A condition; a set of circumstances applying at any given time.) / دَوْلَة (A polity or community.) / وِلَايَة (A polity or community.) / يُبْدِي (To make known.)  [to state]",
 "申し送り": "رِسَالَة, خَبَر (A communication, or what is communicated; any concept or information conveyed.)  [message] / حَوَّلَ (To move or pass from one place, person or thing to another.) / اِنْتِقَال (act)  [transfer]",
