 "直ぐ": "فَوْرًا, حَالًا (In an immediate manner; instantly or without delay.)  [immediately]\nمثال: 彼は警官を見るとすぐ、逃げた。\n→ As soon as he saw a policeman, he ran away. / قَرِيبًا, سَرْعَانَ مَا (Within a short time; quickly.)  [soon]\nمثال: 「雨がすぐあがるでしょうか」「あがらないと思うよ」\n→ \"Will it stop raining soon?\" \"I'm afraid not.\" / بِسُهُولَة (Without difficulty.)  [easily] / يَمِين, يمين (Clockwise, particularly when describing a change in direction or orientation.) / صَحِيح, صَوَاب (Complying with justice, correctness, or reason; correct, just, true. See also th) / قَائِم (Of an angle, measuring 90 degrees, or one quarter of a complete rotation; the an) / عَلَى اَلْيَمِين (On the right side.) / إِلَى اَلْيَمِين (Towards the right side.) / صحيح, تمام (Yes, that is correct; I agree.) / حَقّ, حُقُوق (A legal, just or moral entitlement.) / يَمِين (A wave breaking from right to left (viewed from the shore).) / صَحَّحَ (To correct.)  [right (near)]\nمثال: すぐわかるところにあるよ。\n→ It's in plain sight.",
