 "直ぐそば": "بِالْقُرْب مِن, بِجَانِب (Near.)  [close to]\nمثال: すぐそばでかすかな音がした。\n→ I heard a faint sound nearby.",
 "直ぐと": "فَوْرًا, حَالًا (In an immediate manner; instantly or without delay.)  [immediately] / مُبَاشَرَةً (In a direct manner; in a straight line or course.)  [directly]",
 "直ぐに": "فَوْرًا, حَالًا (In an immediate manner; instantly or without delay.)  [immediately]\nمثال: あなたはすぐに良くなるだろうと思います。\n→ I hope you'll soon get well.",
