 "移しかえる": "حَوَّلَ (To move or pass from one place, person or thing to another.) / اِنْتِقَال (act)  [to transfer]\nesp. 移し変える / تَبْدِيل, تَبَادُل (An act of exchanging or trading.) / بُورْصَة, تَدَاوُل (A place for conducting trading.) / تَبَادَلَ, صَرَفَ (To trade or barter.)  [to exchange]\nesp. 移し替える, 移し換える",
 "移し変える": "حَوَّلَ (To move or pass from one place, person or thing to another.) / اِنْتِقَال (act)  [to transfer]\nesp. 移し変える / تَبْدِيل, تَبَادُل (An act of exchanging or trading.) / بُورْصَة, تَدَاوُل (A place for conducting trading.) / تَبَادَلَ, صَرَفَ (To trade or barter.)  [to exchange]\nesp. 移し替える, 移し換える",
