 "稀": "نَادِر (Very uncommon; scarce.)  [rare]\nمثال: チャンスというものはいずれにしても、まれにしかない。\n→ Chances come rarely in any case.",
 "稀に見る": "نَادِر (Very uncommon; scarce.)  [rare]\nمثال: 彼は稀に見る勤勉な男だ。\n→ He is as diligent a man as ever lived.",
 "稀ガス": "غَازٌ خَامِل (Any of the elements of group 18 of the periodic table, being monatomic, usually )  [noble gas]",
 "稀世": "نَادِر (Very uncommon; scarce.)  [rare]",
 "稀代": "نَادِر (Very uncommon; scarce.)  [rare]",
 "稀少": "نَادِر (Uncommon, rare; difficult to find; insufficient to meet a demand.)  [scarce]\nمثال: 古代において塩は希少で貴重な商品であった。\n→ Salt was a rare and costly commodity in ancient times.",
 "稀有": "نَادِر (Very uncommon; scarce.)  [rare]",
 "稀薄": "رَفِيع, رَقِيق (Having little thickness or extent from one surface to its opposite.) / ضعيف, ضعيفة (Having little body fat or flesh; slim; slender; lean; gaunt.)  [thin (air)]\nمثال: 高く登るにつれて、空気は希薄になる。\n→ As you go up higher, the air becomes thinner. / نَقْص, عَدَم وُجُود (A deficiency or need (of something desirable or necessary); an absence, want, de)  [lacking (enthusiasm, consideration, substance, etc.)]",
 "稀覯": "نَادِر (Very uncommon; scarce.)  [rare (book, manuscript, etc.)]",
 "稃": "بَيْضَة (An approximately spherical or ellipsoidal body produced by birds, insects, repti)  [egg]",
 "程": "اِتِّسَاع, مَدَّى (The space, area, volume, point, or abstract location, to which something extends)  [extent]\nمثال: スージーほど上手にピアノをひけるとよいのだが。\n→ I wish I could play the piano as well as Susie. / حَدّ (A restriction; a bound beyond which one may not go or proceed.) / نِهَايَة (A value to which a sequence converges. Equivalently, the common value of the upp) / حَدَّ, حَدَّدَ (To restrict; to circumscribe; not to allow to go beyond a certain bound, to set )  [limit]\nمثال: ２０ほどの問題で意見の一致をみている。\n→ Some 20 issues have been agreed on. / وَقْت (A duration of time.) / مَرَّة, مرة (An instant of time.) / وَقْت (An instant of time.) / حِين, وَقْت (A ratio of comparison (see also usage notes and prepositional sense at 'times').)  [(span of) time]\nمثال: 「小川さんはいつ来たか」「１０分ほど前だ」\n→ \"When did Mr Ogawa arrive?\" \"Ten minutes ago.\" / بُعْد ((countable, uncountable) amount of space between points) / مَسَافَة ((countable, uncountable) amount of space between points) / بَعَّدَ (Often followed by from.)  [(a) distance]\nمثال: ここから３キロほど川上に村が１つある。\n→ There is a village about three kilometers up the river from here.",
 "程々": "مُعْتَدِل (Not excessive; acting in moderation.)  [moderate]\nمثال: 酒を飲むのはほどほどにするように。\n→ Try to be moderate in drinking.",
 "程なく": "قَرِيبًا, سَرْعَانَ مَا (Within a short time; quickly.)  [soon]\nمثال: 彼女はほどなくやってきた。\n→ It was not long before she came.",
 "程なくして": "قَرِيبًا, سَرْعَانَ مَا (Within a short time; quickly.)  [soon]",
 "程に": "كَـ, مِثْل (To such an extent or degree; to the same extent or degree.) / مِثْل, كَـ (Introducing a basis of comparison, with an object in the objective case.)  [as]\nمثال: 撥ね付けられるほどに増すわが思い。\n→ The more she spurns my love, the more it grows. / مُدَّة (uncertain duration of time, a period of time) / فَتْرَة (uncertain duration of time, a period of time) / فِي حِين, بَيْنَمَا (During the same time that.)  [while] / لِأَنَّ (By or for the cause that; on this account that; for the reason that.) / هكذا, بلا سبب (Used alone to refuse to provide a full answer to a question begun with \"why\", us)  [because]",
 "程ほど": "مُعْتَدِل (Not excessive; acting in moderation.)  [moderate]\nمثال: 酒を飲むのはほどほどにするように。\n→ Try to be moderate in drinking.",
 "程よい": "مُعْتَدِل (Not excessive; acting in moderation.)  [moderate]\nمثال: 私の物は君の程よくありません。\n→ Mine is not so good as yours. / [proper ; just right]",
 "程よく": "كَمَا يَجِب, كَمَا يَنْبَغِي (In a proper manner, appropriately, suitably; correctly, justifiably)  [properly]",
 "程合い": "اِعْتِدَال (The state or quality of being moderate; avoidance of extremes.) / إِشْرَاف (The process of moderating a discussion.)  [moderation]",
 "程好い": "مُعْتَدِل (Not excessive; acting in moderation.)  [moderate]\nمثال: 私の物は君の程よくありません。\n→ Mine is not so good as yours. / [proper ; just right]",
 "程度": "دَرَجَة (A unit of measurement of angle equal to ¹⁄₃₆₀ of a circle's circumference.)  [degree]\nمثال: この程度のお金じゃ長くは持たないだろう。\n→ This sum of money won't go far.",
 "程無く": "قَرِيبًا, سَرْعَانَ مَا (Within a short time; quickly.)  [soon]\nمثال: 彼女はほどなくやってきた。\n→ It was not long before she came."
